            <ArticleTitle>Hypoplastic left heart syndrome with coronary-cameral fistulas: Echocardiographic demonstration of coronary artery steal and successful interventional treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>306-309</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4103/apc.APC_22_17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of a patient with hypoplastic left heart syndrome with significant coronary-cameral fistulas and exertional symptoms from coronary steal. Symptoms resolved following successful coil occlusion of his left ventricle.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
